            "body": "the windows test failing seems to be not related with my changes\r\n\r\nI added a teset in ui_spec.lua\r\nand it passes:\r\n-------- Running tests from test/functional/api/ui_spec.lua\r\nRUN      T892 nvim_ui_attach() handles very large width/height #2180: 185.48 ms OK\r\nRUN      T893 nvim_ui_attach() validation: 61.05 ms OK\r\nRUN      T894 nvim_ui_attach() does not crash if maximum UI count is reached: 119.10 ms OK\r\nRUN      T895 nvim_ui_send works with stdout_tty: 147.04 ms OK\r\nRUN      T896 nvim_ui_send ignores ui_send event for UIs without stdout_tty: 174.17 ms OK\r\nRUN      T897 UI event channels sets chan for UIEnter/UILeave: 81.27 ms OK\r\nRUN      T898 UI event channels sets chan for TermResponse and filters tty requests: 62.18 ms OK\r\nRUN      T899 autocmds VimSuspend/VimResume #22041: 128.01 ms OK\r\n==> `RUN      T900 does not crash on self-attach via nvim_ui_attach RPC: 2.01 ms OK`\r\n-------- 9 tests from test/functional/api/ui_spec.lua (960.30 ms total)",
